<title>UK: Merrydown warns profits below expectations.</title>
<headline>Merrydown warns profits below expectations.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>British drinks manufacturer Merrydown Plc warned on Wednesday that its results for the year to March 31, 1997 would fall &quot;significantly&quot; below current market expectations.</p>
</text>
